.Sh HISTORY
The KEYMGMT interface was introduced in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
Functions
.Fn OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_import_types_ex ,
and
.Fn OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_export_types_ex
were added with OpenSSL 3.2.
.Pp
The functions
.Fn OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_gen_get_params
and
.Fn OSSL_FUNC_keymgmt_gen_gettable_params
were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
.Pp
The parameters "sign-check" and "fips-indicator" were added in OpenSSL
3.4.
.Pp
Support for the
.Sy ML-DSA ,
.Sy ML-KEM
and
.Sy SLH-DSA
algorithms was added in OpenSSL 3.5.
